      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why that code was removed.  We have it there for the following scenario:\n\n1. EC boots into EC-RO\n2. EC boots AP.\n3. AP tells EC (as part of software sync) to sysjump to EC-RW\u003e\n4. AP continues booting.\n\nIf the GPIOs initialize to an AP-is-off state (for example, deasserting ALLPWRGOOD), then when EC-RW runs gpio_pre_init() in step 3, it will turn off the AP.",
